    en-US: ALARM - Sensor mismatch
  - id: MLC_53t
    en-US: ALARM - Sensor conflict
  - id: MLC_4Kc
    en-US: ALARM - Failed to retract
  - id: MLC_4GK
    en-US: ALARM - Failed  to extend
